      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This brown leafy plant shoots out seeds at its opponents and is commonly found in pairs or more. They have the ability to shoot multiple shoots at once that can confuse its enemy.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 22, touch 17, flat-footed 16 (+6 dex, +5 natural, +1 size)</p><p>HP 123 [169] (13d8+65)</p><p>Fort +12, Reflex +10, Will +8</p><p>Immune plant traits; Resist Earth 10, Water 15;</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 10 ft.</p><p>Range 4 Seeds +16 (1d6+2, 30 ft. range)</p><p>Special Attacks Seed Burst, Seed Cannon</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 14, Dex 22, Con 18, Int 2, Wis 18, Cha 8</p><p>Base Atk +9; CMB +10; CMD 26</p><p>Feats Clustered Shots, Improved Initiative, Improved Natural Attack, Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot, Toughness</p><p>Skills Perception +18, Stealth +20 (+24 in desert); Racial Modifiers +4 Stealth in desert</p>"
      }
